paragraphs.en:
O green stream within the blue mountains, do not boast of how swiftly you go;
once you reach the sea it is hard to return,
so while the bright moon fills the empty mountain, what harm in resting a while?

O green cassia tree within the blue mountains, do not boast of how swiftly you go;
once you reach the sea it is hard to come again,
so while the bright moon fills the empty mountain, what harm in resting a while?

O green stream within the blue mountains,
do not boast of how easily you move away;
once you reach the sea you will not come back.
The bright moon fills the empty mountain;
rest a moment and then go on, what of it?
